    "section": "8.96",
    "heading": "Knocking Out a Creature",
    "lineStart": 13395,
    "lineEnd": 13399
  },
  "section": "8.96",
  "rulesText": "When you would reduce a creature to 0 Hit Points with a melee attack, you can instead reduce the creature to 1 Hit Point. The creature then has the Unconscious condition and starts a Short Rest.\n\nThe creature remains Unconscious until it regains any Hit Points or until someone uses an action to administer first aid to it, which requires a successful DC 10 Wisdom (Medicine) check."
}
